{"3795000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Open Robot", "steam_appid": 3795000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open Robot: Genesis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a gripping adventure as Theo, the founder of Open Robot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theo fights to protect his daughter, Alaia, and the remnants of his team—outlaws clinging to survival. Haunted by unknown forces seeking control of Genesis, an advanced Open Robot technology with the potential to reshape the world. They must survive while confronting a desperate gamble: unleashing an untested and potentially dangerous technology upon the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a rich quest-driven narrative and immersive gameplay, experience the thrill of survival, combat and exploration in a world where technology and humanity are on a collision course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/0560794b0502fb588a7b94eac6802784.poster.avif?t=1777309249\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/0560794b0502fb588a7b94eac6802784.webm?t=1777309249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/0560794b0502fb588a7b94eac6802784.mp4?t=1777309249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Modes, Two Experiences: </strong>Choose your challenge. Immerse yourself in the central plot and character-driven moments in <strong>Story Mode</strong>, or test your combat skills against waves of relentless enemies in the challenging <strong>Survivor Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/3f91462d7b15ea0cf9cd8bbf9af2a83b.avif?t=1777309249\" width=1560 height=833 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Intense Combat: </strong>Prepare for visceral combat encounters against determined enemies. Master a variety of weapons and dynamic fighting techniques to defend your allies and survive the threats hunting you down.  <br><strong>An Open World: </strong>Explore the island and its secrets, story and dangers. Tackle quests at your own pace, hop into a car and drive freely across the terrain, forging your own path of exploration between story objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/ceecad99a896aa3db52898199f97e2e7.poster.avif?t=1777309249\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/ceecad99a896aa3db52898199f97e2e7.webm?t=1777309249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/ceecad99a896aa3db52898199f97e2e7.mp4?t=1777309249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a Compelling Narrative: </strong>Interact with a core cast of characters, each with their own stake in the unfolding story. Progress through a compelling, quest-driven main story and take on optional side quests to uncover more about the world and earn valuable rewards.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open Robot: Genesis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a gripping adventure as Theo, the founder of Open Robot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theo fights to protect his daughter, Alaia, and the remnants of his team—outlaws clinging to survival. Haunted by unknown forces seeking control of Genesis, an advanced Open Robot technology with the potential to reshape the world. They must survive while confronting a desperate gamble: unleashing an untested and potentially dangerous technology upon the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a rich quest-driven narrative and immersive gameplay, experience the thrill of survival, combat and exploration in a world where technology and humanity are on a collision course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/0560794b0502fb588a7b94eac6802784.poster.avif?t=1777309249\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/0560794b0502fb588a7b94eac6802784.webm?t=1777309249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/0560794b0502fb588a7b94eac6802784.mp4?t=1777309249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Modes, Two Experiences: </strong>Choose your challenge. Immerse yourself in the central plot and character-driven moments in <strong>Story Mode</strong>, or test your combat skills against waves of relentless enemies in the challenging <strong>Survivor Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/3f91462d7b15ea0cf9cd8bbf9af2a83b.avif?t=1777309249\" width=1560 height=833 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Intense Combat: </strong>Prepare for visceral combat encounters against determined enemies. Master a variety of weapons and dynamic fighting techniques to defend your allies and survive the threats hunting you down.  <br><strong>An Open World: </strong>Explore the island and its secrets, story and dangers. Tackle quests at your own pace, hop into a car and drive freely across the terrain, forging your own path of exploration between story objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/ceecad99a896aa3db52898199f97e2e7.poster.avif?t=1777309249\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/ceecad99a896aa3db52898199f97e2e7.webm?t=1777309249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/extras/ceecad99a896aa3db52898199f97e2e7.mp4?t=1777309249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a Compelling Narrative: </strong>Interact with a core cast of characters, each with their own stake in the unfolding story. Progress through a compelling, quest-driven main story and take on optional side quests to uncover more about the world and earn valuable rewards.</p>", "short_description": "Sci-fi third-person shooter action adventure. Shoot your enemies, protect your daughter and technology, find weapons and supplies. Explore the island by car and talk to other characters to find out who is hunting your technology. Endure this quest-driven fight for survival. Story and Survivor modes.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/37950